  "question": {
    "text": "<div>\r<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span>The half-life for decay of radioactive &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow></mrow> <mrow> <mn>14</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mtext>C</mtext> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;is 5730 years. An archaeological artefact containing wood has only 80% of the &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mrow></mrow> <mrow> <mn>14</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mtext>C</mtext> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;activity as found in living trees. The age of the artefact would be:<br />\r[Given: log 1.25 = 0.0969]</span></p>\r</div>\r",
